	(text "PS_MIO_VREF = 0.9 V (HSTL 1.8 V RGMII receivers): 10 k / 10 k + 10 n.\nPS_SRST_B: 10 k to VCCO_MIO1; must stay high while the BootROM runs (no button)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "086df52a-31f7-50be-85ba-6eee4d2bbaba")
	)
	(text "Boot straps (sampled at PS_POR_B release), 20 k each, pull-ups to VCCO_MIO0 (1V8):\nMIO2 = 0 JTAG cascaded, MIO5/4/3 = 1/0/0 QSPI boot, MIO6 = 0 PLLs on, MIO7 = 1 / MIO8 = 1: banks 500/501\nat 1.8 V (must match VCCO_MIO0/1). PS_POR_B: open drain from the supervisor (sheet 4), 10 k up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4c277da0-9f6b-54df-9e49-8ef372640fb1")
	)
	(text "CFGBVS to GND: bank 0 at 1.8 V. XADC unused: VCCADC 1V8, analog inputs to GND.\nRSVDGND open (UG865 v1.9; REUSE_LOG E8). RSVDVCC to VCCO_0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4f50550f-2b2b-59c1-9744-14fcdb55434d")
	)
	(text "JTAG pulls: TCK 1 k down, TMS/TDI 10 k up (3.3 V side);\n10 k up on TDO at 1.8 V (B4 defined while TDO is off)."
